{"seq":3,"slug":"filtering-and-sorting","title":"条件过滤与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/filtering-and-sorting","wordCount":912,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"条件过滤与排序\">条件过滤与排序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WHERE 子句和 ORDER BY 子句是 SQL 查询中控制&quot;选哪些数据&quot;和&quot;按什么顺序返回&quot;的核心机制。WHERE 通过布尔条件过滤行，ORDER BY 对结果集排序。高效的过滤和排序直接依赖索引设计——一个没有索引支持的 WHERE 条件意味着全表扫描。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[查询请求] --&gt; B{WHERE 条件}&#10;    B --&gt;|有索引| C[索引扫描]&#10;    B --&gt;|无索引| D[全表扫描]&#10;    C --&gt; E[过滤结果]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{ORDER BY}&#10;    F --&gt;|有索引| G[索引排序]&#10;    F --&gt;|无索引| H[内存/磁盘排序]&#10;    G --&gt; I[返回结果]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;&#10;    subgraph 性能关键&#10;        J[复合索引覆盖 WHERE + ORDER BY]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[查询请求] --&gt; B{WHERE 条件}\n    B --&gt;|有索引| C[索引扫描]\n    B --&gt;|无索引| D[全表扫描]\n    C --&gt; E[过滤结果]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{ORDER BY}\n    F --&gt;|有索引| G[索引排序]\n    F --&gt;|无索引| H[内存/磁盘排序]\n    G --&gt; I[返回结果]\n    H --&gt; I\n\n    subgraph 性能关键\n        J[复合索引覆盖 WHERE + ORDER BY]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运算符类别</th>\n<th>运算符</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>可利用索引</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>比较</td>\n<td>=, &lt;&gt;, &lt;, &gt;, &lt;=, &gt;=</td>\n<td>price &gt; 100</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>BETWEEN ... AND</td>\n<td>price BETWEEN 10 AND 100</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合</td>\n<td>IN (...)</td>\n<td>status IN (1, 2, 3)</td>\n<td>是（少量值时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式匹配</td>\n<td>LIKE / ILIKE</td>\n<td>name LIKE &#39;张%&#39;</td>\n<td>前缀匹配时可以</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空值</td>\n<td>IS NULL / IS NOT NULL</td>\n<td>phone IS NOT NULL</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑</td>\n<td>AND, OR, NOT</td>\n<td>a &gt; 1 AND b &lt; 10</td>\n<td>AND 可组合，OR 需注意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"比较与范围过滤\">比较与范围过滤</h2><p>基础比较运算符是 WHERE 条件的基石。组合使用多个条件时，AND 和 OR 的优先级以及索引利用率是关键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const filterExamples = `&#10;-- 等值过滤（最高效，直接命中索引）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id = 12345;&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = &#39;alice@example.com&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 范围过滤&#10;SELECT * FROM orders &#10;WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-01-01&#39; &#10;  AND created_at &lt; &#39;2024-02-01&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- BETWEEN 等价于 &gt;= AND &lt;=&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;WHERE price BETWEEN 100 AND 500;&#10;&#10;-- IN 列表（优化器通常展开为多个 OR 或使用哈希查找）&#10;SELECT * FROM orders &#10;WHERE status IN (1, 2, 5);&#10;&#10;-- NOT IN 的陷阱：如果列表包含 NULL，结果为空&#10;-- NOT IN (1, 2, NULL) 对任何值都返回 UNKNOWN&#10;-- 安全替代：NOT EXISTS&#10;SELECT * FROM products p&#10;WHERE NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM blacklist b WHERE b.product_id = p.product_id&#10;);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> filterExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 等值过滤（最高效，直接命中索引）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id = 12345;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = 'alice@example.com';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 范围过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE created_at >= '2024-01-01' </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  AND created_at &#x3C; '2024-02-01';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- BETWEEN 等价于 >= AND &#x3C;=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE price BETWEEN 100 AND 500;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- IN 列表（优化器通常展开为多个 OR 或使用哈希查找）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE status IN (1, 2, 5);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- NOT IN 的陷阱：如果列表包含 NULL，结果为空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- NOT IN (1, 2, NULL) 对任何值都返回 UNKNOWN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 安全替代：NOT EXISTS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE NOT EXISTS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT 1 FROM blacklist b WHERE b.product_id = p.product_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AND 条件可以被复合索引有效利用，而 OR 条件通常需要索引合并（Index Merge）或改写为 UNION：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件模式</th>\n<th>索引利用</th>\n<th>优化建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>a = 1 AND b = 2</td>\n<td>复合索引 (a, b)</td>\n<td>最高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>a = 1 OR a = 2</td>\n<td>单列索引 a</td>\n<td>等价于 IN (1, 2)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>a = 1 OR b = 2</td>\n<td>可能 Index Merge</td>\n<td>考虑改写为 UNION</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOT IN (NULL, ...)</td>\n<td>索引可能失效</td>\n<td>用 NOT EXISTS 替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>func(a) = 1</td>\n<td>索引失效</td>\n<td>创建函数索引或改写条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"like-模式匹配\">LIKE 模式匹配</h2><p>LIKE 运算符用于字符串模式匹配。<code>%</code> 匹配任意字符序列，<code>_</code> 匹配单个字符。前缀匹配（<code>&#39;abc%&#39;</code>）可以利用 B-Tree 索引，而中缀或后缀匹配需要全表扫描。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const patternMatching = `&#10;-- 前缀匹配（可利用索引）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE username LIKE &#39;张%&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 后缀匹配（无法利用普通索引）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE email LIKE &#39;%@gmail.com&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 包含匹配（全表扫描）&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE description LIKE &#39;%蓝牙%&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 转义特殊字符&#10;SELECT * FROM logs WHERE message LIKE &#39;%100\\%%&#39; ESCAPE &#39;\\\\&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL 正则匹配（更强大但更慢）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE email ~ &#39;^[a-z]+@gmail\\\\.com$&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 全文搜索替代 LIKE（PostgreSQL）&#10;SELECT * FROM articles &#10;WHERE to_tsvector(&#39;chinese&#39;, content) @@ to_tsquery(&#39;chinese&#39;, &#39;机器学习&#39;);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> patternMatching</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 前缀匹配（可利用索引）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE username LIKE '张%';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 后缀匹配（无法利用普通索引）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE email LIKE '%@gmail.com';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 包含匹配（全表扫描）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products WHERE description LIKE '%蓝牙%';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 转义特殊字符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM logs WHERE message LIKE '%100</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\%</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%' ESCAPE '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- PostgreSQL 正则匹配（更强大但更慢）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE email ~ '^[a-z]+@gmail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.com$';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 全文搜索替代 LIKE（PostgreSQL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM articles </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE to_tsvector('chinese', content) @@ to_tsquery('chinese', '机器学习');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于频繁的模糊搜索需求，PostgreSQL 的 pg_trgm 扩展提供了 GIN/GiST 索引支持，可以加速 <code>LIKE &#39;%keyword%&#39;</code> 类查询。这是将全表扫描转变为索引扫描的有效方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"order-by-排序策略\">ORDER BY 排序策略</h2><p>ORDER BY 定义结果集的排列顺序。每个排序表达式可以独立指定 ASC（升序，默认）或 DESC（降序），以及 NULL 值的位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const orderByExamples = `&#10;-- 基础排序&#10;SELECT * FROM products ORDER BY price ASC;&#10;SELECT * FROM products ORDER BY created_at DESC;&#10;&#10;-- 多列排序（先按 category 升序，同 category 内按 price 降序）&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;ORDER BY category_id ASC, price DESC;&#10;&#10;-- NULL 排序控制&#10;SELECT * FROM users &#10;ORDER BY last_login DESC NULLS LAST;&#10;&#10;-- 表达式排序&#10;SELECT *, (price * (1 - discount_rate)) AS final_price&#10;FROM products&#10;ORDER BY final_price ASC;&#10;&#10;-- 条件排序（CASE 在 ORDER BY 中）&#10;SELECT * FROM tasks&#10;ORDER BY &#10;    CASE priority&#10;        WHEN &#39;critical&#39; THEN 1&#10;        WHEN &#39;high&#39; THEN 2&#10;        WHEN &#39;medium&#39; THEN 3&#10;        WHEN &#39;low&#39; THEN 4&#10;    END ASC,&#10;    created_at ASC;&#10;&#10;-- 排序规则（Collation）影响字符串排序&#10;SELECT * FROM users ORDER BY username COLLATE &quot;zh_CN.utf8&quot;;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> orderByExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 基础排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products ORDER BY price ASC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products ORDER BY created_at DESC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多列排序（先按 category 升序，同 category 内按 price 降序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY category_id ASC, price DESC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- NULL 排序控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY last_login DESC NULLS LAST;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 表达式排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT *, (price * (1 - discount_rate)) AS final_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY final_price ASC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 条件排序（CASE 在 ORDER BY 中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM tasks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CASE priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN 'critical' THEN 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN 'high' THEN 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN 'medium' THEN 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN 'low' THEN 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    END ASC,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    created_at ASC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 排序规则（Collation）影响字符串排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users ORDER BY username COLLATE \"zh_CN.utf8\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ORDER BY 的性能与索引密切相关。如果 ORDER BY 的列与 WHERE 条件的列可以被同一个复合索引覆盖，数据库可以直接按索引顺序返回结果，避免额外排序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询模式</th>\n<th>需要的索引</th>\n<th>排序方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WHERE a = ? ORDER BY b</td>\n<td>INDEX (a, b)</td>\n<td>索引排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE a = ? ORDER BY b DESC</td>\n<td>INDEX (a, b DESC)</td>\n<td>索引排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE a &gt; ? ORDER BY a</td>\n<td>INDEX (a)</td>\n<td>索引排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ORDER BY a, b</td>\n<td>INDEX (a, b)</td>\n<td>索引排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ORDER BY a ASC, b DESC</td>\n<td>INDEX (a ASC, b DESC)</td>\n<td>索引排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE a = ? ORDER BY c</td>\n<td>INDEX (a) + filesort</td>\n<td>部分索引 + 内存排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分页与-limit\">分页与 LIMIT</h2><p>LIMIT/OFFSET 是最常用的分页方式，但在大偏移量时性能急剧下降，因为数据库需要扫描并丢弃 OFFSET 行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const paginationPatterns = `&#10;-- 基础分页（小数据量可用）&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;ORDER BY product_id&#10;LIMIT 20 OFFSET 0;    -- 第 1 页&#10;&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;ORDER BY product_id&#10;LIMIT 20 OFFSET 100;  -- 第 6 页&#10;&#10;-- 大偏移量性能问题：OFFSET 10000 需要扫描前 10000 行&#10;-- Keyset 分页（游标分页）— 性能恒定&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;WHERE product_id &gt; 10000   -- 上一页最后一条的 ID&#10;ORDER BY product_id&#10;LIMIT 20;&#10;&#10;-- 复合排序键的 Keyset 分页&#10;SELECT * FROM products&#10;WHERE (created_at, product_id) &gt; (&#39;2024-01-15&#39;, 5678)&#10;ORDER BY created_at, product_id&#10;LIMIT 20;&#10;&#10;-- FETCH FIRST（SQL 标准语法）&#10;SELECT * FROM products &#10;ORDER BY price DESC&#10;FETCH FIRST 10 ROWS ONLY;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paginationPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 基础分页（小数据量可用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY product_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LIMIT 20 OFFSET 0;    -- 第 1 页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY product_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LIMIT 20 OFFSET 100;  -- 第 6 页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 大偏移量性能问题：OFFSET 10000 需要扫描前 10000 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Keyset 分页（游标分页）— 性能恒定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id > 10000   -- 上一页最后一条的 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY product_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LIMIT 20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 复合排序键的 Keyset 分页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE (created_at, product_id) > ('2024-01-15', 5678)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY created_at, product_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LIMIT 20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- FETCH FIRST（SQL 标准语法）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY price DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FETCH FIRST 10 ROWS ONLY;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分页方式</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>支持跳页</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LIMIT/OFFSET</td>\n<td>O(offset + limit)</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>前几页、数据量小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Keyset</td>\n<td>O(limit)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无限滚动、大数据集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>游标</td>\n<td>O(limit)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>服务端分页</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WHERE 条件的索引利用率决定查询性能，AND 条件适合复合索引，OR 条件可能需要改写为 UNION</li>\n<li>NOT IN 包含 NULL 值时会导致空结果集，应使用 NOT EXISTS 替代</li>\n<li>LIKE 只有前缀匹配能利用 B-Tree 索引，模糊搜索建议使用全文搜索或 pg_trgm</li>\n<li>ORDER BY 与 WHERE 共享复合索引可以避免额外排序操作</li>\n<li>LIMIT/OFFSET 在大偏移量时性能差，Keyset 分页（游标分页）是大数据集的标准方案</li>\n<li>NULL 在排序中默认位置因数据库而异，建议显式指定 NULLS FIRST / NULLS LAST</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"条件过滤与排序","id":"条件过滤与排序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"比较与范围过滤","id":"比较与范围过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"LIKE 模式匹配","id":"like-模式匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"ORDER BY 排序策略","id":"order-by-排序策略"},{"level":2,"text":"分页与 LIMIT","id":"分页与-limit"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SELECT 查询基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/select-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"连接查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/joins"}}